.TH fedorajam-audio-config 1 "24 January 2026" "1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fedorajam-audio-config \- GUI to configure PipeWire\-JACK settings for Fedora Jam
.SH SYNOPSIS
fedorajam-audio-config
.SH DESCRIPTION
fedorajam-audio-config is a small graphical utility to adjust PipeWire and JACK related
settings for interactive, low-latency audio sessions on Fedora Jam. It provides an
easy-to-use interface for common configuration tasks.
.SH SEE ALSO
fedorajam-pwjack-config(1)
